== Welcome!
I am a Ph.D student (under the supervision of [http://alpage.inria.fr/~sagot/ Benoît Sagot]), in the [https://team.inria.fr/almanach/fr/ ALMAnaCH team] in [https://www.inria.fr/centre/paris Inria Paris]. 
I work on 
- using neural networks for historical linguistics, 
- improving low resource machine translation
- and sometimes, neural network interpretability

Before that, I worked as a software engineer for a couple of years (see my [https://www.linkedin.com/in/clefourrier/ LinkedIn]).

